{"title":"1960 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Analysis\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Analysis</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Construction\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Construction</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Discussion\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Discussion</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Construct triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/6285969f5a1da0e59d0c56ebf40efeb54755b342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0876925308bdf5c4e764f385a7fbd317eecb646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h_b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> (the altitudes from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />), and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/118f289933efd083c908bcb66c1d9582eef3b9b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" />, the median from vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3e45c43b8970ff9fb177416c747c508bd18250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/3/44338bb0288926894038a8954c196688b3365a87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/0/480cc240e9da5bb0b22a7038358266e748c4d0ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> be the midpoints of sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/b/fbb0f1d8a43539dbc3355734bafb2bfd855b5f87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CA}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />, respectively. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/a/dca0b8b78dc99e37fca40a561bd56f6e867f9795.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c83362a53c7a31d3e0091d7a62ba2aaa2dd98f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H_b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a3236866691f699e573c558eb15bb75d7d035d32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H_c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> be the feet of the altitudes from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to their opposite sides, respectively. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a0f722db6f274ecd269b8451e922be0fcbc448.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle M_bM_aC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"16\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/1/3b1bd8055ebee634b46c66802c2c3fc6d2af7d05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_bM_a=\\frac12 AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"115\" height=\"37\" />, the distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3e45c43b8970ff9fb177416c747c508bd18250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> to side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/d/86da84a6d833383be325d6bc9be88fefe151bf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{h_b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"19\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Construct <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f59d4b72282159f4c3b206de28a5a14b71ff752d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"15\" /> with length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/118f289933efd083c908bcb66c1d9582eef3b9b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" />. Draw a circle centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/6285969f5a1da0e59d0c56ebf40efeb54755b342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />. Construct the tangent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee61fd6e8a1926a802b97fc99b66b8687d8f620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"11\" height=\"15\" /> to this circle through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3e45c43b8970ff9fb177416c747c508bd18250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee61fd6e8a1926a802b97fc99b66b8687d8f620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"11\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Draw a circle centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3e45c43b8970ff9fb177416c747c508bd18250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/d/86da84a6d833383be325d6bc9be88fefe151bf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{h_b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"19\" height=\"37\" />. Construct the tangent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d69232050ab0ada641e7e2035f6e7c795795b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"11\" height=\"15\" /> to this circle through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d69232050ab0ada641e7e2035f6e7c795795b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"11\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/0/550a66efc8ce8b8e7ba254958e8c065e32039239.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=l_1\\cap l_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Construct the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae2bcc4fbcb6dd28f70ea584900c95e658c7efea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d69232050ab0ada641e7e2035f6e7c795795b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"11\" height=\"15\" /> so that the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d69232050ab0ada641e7e2035f6e7c795795b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"11\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae2bcc4fbcb6dd28f70ea584900c95e658c7efea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0876925308bdf5c4e764f385a7fbd317eecb646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h_b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3e45c43b8970ff9fb177416c747c508bd18250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> lies between these lines. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae2bcc4fbcb6dd28f70ea584900c95e658c7efea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/2/e02231666ad08e2eb1ec2cbbf4f2d92f0e008e9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=l_1\\cap l_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/M0_UdvxH890\">https://youtu.be/M0_UdvxH890</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Analysis\">Analysis</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Analysis\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1090530ae883b627e090bfb5e450ef796febca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c71f19552a05ee5e2b31e94aff3fb986884bf31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B&#39;$\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the feet of the perpendiculars from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, respectively, to the opposite sides, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c7f3f828cf12ab9cafeffad282468a95219600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/3/b239e47c75fa1adfb0e7d7fb6bf219fcc53f86d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D&#39;$\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> be the foot of perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c7f3f828cf12ab9cafeffad282468a95219600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. We then have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/3/c93373f0eb1e7d86cdf17a12a43f12178f7d862d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AA_1=m_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/2/18289daa4cb8b30e847240a73ad15340a1aff345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AA&#39;=h_a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/0/8e08badc8a7a8f0c62df6fd0ed3de698088fb805.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AA&#39;A_1=90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e4bccd3cdc7ef340c4f0ddb3a741eee1c3f410.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1D&#39;=h_b/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/1441053301fd2c920ae589d089e78697a1a31503.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AD&#39;A_1=90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Construction\">Construction</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Construction\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We construct the quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/6/e161b71497a86a62f6ab50babb3eec6235ae2b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD&#39;A_1A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"19\" /> through the circle with diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f0bd1bf44e9dd29cf5383c208c802b0dccb4920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AA_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"17\" /> and cyclically inversive mappings. Then, we mark intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/b/fabda873ff3962e69724161aeeea20295ecd0f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad8019d0fb176ff1ade21d8a9e6d6aa4a1f9563a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"16\" /> as required point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and required point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> as a point on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/5/f15bf9e4ebbc4a62dfacca07a8581bbabd49bcf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"15\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5ccbbeb8f1cb1544a4732808287b807b606fca92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA_1=A_1B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/394e5319fc5695caca663bb4264f824f37b13989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B,A_1,C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> spirally cyclic.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Discussion\">Discussion</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Discussion\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The number of solutions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> if all of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/d/28d2656bb887178c852e830746e9027f4e233884.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_a,h_a,h_b/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" /> are equal, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> if two of them are equal, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> if all are distinct.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.